Brazil’s 2023 documentary universe for Lula and Chapter 4B is anchored in a few dense families: official electoral integrity records from the TSE/OAS/STF; government transparency and digital-policy acts from Planalto/CGU/MJSP; press-freedom and digital-rights reporting from FH/HRW/RSF/CPJ/Reuters Institute; and congressional records around the 8 January aftermath and PL 2630. I found a broad candidate set with both favorable and adverse perspectives.

